y differently live compared with the backtest results from last week. Did execution rules change after the update?", "subject_for_processing": "Bot performance looks different from backtest", "message_for_processing": "My automated strategy is behaving very differently live compared with the backtest results from last week. Did execution rules change after the update?", "original_language": "en", "translated": false}, {"ticket_id": "T05", "original_subject": "Need account closure and data deletion", "original_message": "Please close my account and let me know the process to request deletion of my personal data. Also confirm whether anything must be retained for legal reasons.", "subject_for_processing": "Need account closure and data deletion", "message_for_processing": "Please close my account and let me know the process to request deletion of my personal data. Also confirm whether anything must be retained for legal reasons.", "original_language": "en", "translated": false}, {"ticket_id": "T06", "original_subject": "Deposit failed but money debited", "original_message": "Mera bank account se paise cut gaye but deposit platform pe reflect nahi hua. Kya mujhe wait karna chahiye ya complaint raise karu?", "subject_for_processing": "Deposit failed but money debited", "message_for_processing": "Money was cut from my bank account but did not reflect on the deposit platform. Should I wait or raise a complaint?", "original_language": "hi-en", "translated": true}, {"ticket_id": "T07", "original_subject": "Formal complaint if funds remain blocked", "original_message": "If my account remains restricted and my funds stay blocked today, I will file a formal complaint with the regulator. I want a written explanation immediately.", "subject_for_processing": "Formal complaint if funds remain blocked", "message_for_processing": "If my account remains restricted and my funds stay blocked today, I will file a formal complaint with the regulator. I want a written explanation immediat